DESCRIPTION:Full rest or 20-min easy indoor spin at ≤110W (active recover
 y only) — gate remains body battery ≥45 on waking\; if not met\, skip 
 entirely with no substitution.\n\nReason: Given the sleep collapse over th
 e past week\, the power ceiling and gate should be kept conservative to av
 oid digging the fatigue hole deeper before the key weekend sessions.\n\nAI
  coaching 2026-07-31
