DESCRIPTION:14km @ 6:30–6:45/km (90–95 min) with the final 2km at 5:45/
 km (Treviso race pace) as a race-feel closer — only if Aug 9 run was com
 pleted and sleep gate (6.5h avg) met\; otherwise 12km easy.\n\nReason: Ins
 erting a short race-pace finish block at 8 weeks out begins neuromuscular 
 preparation for 5:45/km at Treviso without adding meaningful volume stress
 .\n\nAI coaching 2026-07-31
