DESCRIPTION:15km @ 6:30–6:45/km with 3km at 5:45/km (Treviso race pace) i
 nserted at km 10–13\, then easy cooldown to finish — total ~90–100 m
 in\; skip race-pace segment if morning body battery <50.\n\nReason: At 6 w
 eeks out from Treviso 10K\, a mid-long-run race-pace block is the most rac
 e-specific stimulus available without compromising the aerobic base being 
 built\, and 15km is sufficient volume given the current low fitness starti
 ng point.\n\nAI coaching 2026-07-31
END:VEVENT
