DESCRIPTION:Pool session 60–70 min: 400m warm-up\, then 5 x 400m @ 2:20
 –2:25/100m with 30-sec rest\, 200m cooldown (total ~2\,600m) — this be
 gins building toward the Half Oceanman 5km swim pace target.\n\nReason: Wi
 th the Half Oceanman 5km swim 64 days away and current longest swim at 2km
  open water\, weekly pool volume needs to begin increasing from late Week 
 7 to build toward a 3.5–4km continuous capacity by race week.\n\nAI coac
 hing 2026-07-31
